WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:08,200
Qingshui, you woke me up

2
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:16,630
It was so scary just now

3
00:00:16,630 --> 00:00:17,630
those crazy people

4
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:19,630
It’s like there’s no end to the killing

5
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:21,630
If it weren't for someone looking for trouble

6
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:23,630
You have to give the other party two warnings if you try hard enough.

7
00:00:23,630 --> 00:00:25,630
As for us being stuck in the car

8
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:27,630
Did it almost turn into meat?

9
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:29,720
what does it mean

10
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:30,720
The electric method is so accurate

11
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:34,830
The angry master is so accurate

12
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:36,830
There was no harm from the drug at first sight

13
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,830
It almost sent us all to hell.

14
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:39,830
I was impulsive

15
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:50,220
I just thought those two guys kept shouting

16
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:52,220
Sooner or later it will cause trouble

17
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,220
That's why I took action

18
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:57,820
There is no next time

19
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,820
There's something wrong with that group of people.

20
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:02,890
Maybe we need to make some preparations

21
00:01:02,890 --> 00:01:05,240
Have you finished counting the madmen?
